name: sim.getClosestPosOnPath
description: Returns the position or distance along a path that is closest to a specified point in space
luaSynopsis: float posAlongPath = sim.getClosestPosOnPath(list path, list pathLengths, list absPt)
pythonSynopsis: float posAlongPath = sim.getClosestPosOnPath(float[] path, float[] pathLengths, float[3] absPt)
inputs:
1. path: path, specified in row-major order, with x/y/z values for each path point
2. pathLengths: lengths of a path. Each path point should have a corresponding length value (as the distance from the path's first point, along the path). See also�sim.getPathLengths.
3. absPt: point in 3D space
outputs:
1. posAlongPath: position/distance along the path
replacedBy:
- name: Constructor, class: Path, file: Path_Constructor.method
- name: closest, class: Path, file: Path_closest.method
